&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a talent-dense, high-agency AI safety team at Lila that will engage all core teams within the organization (science, model training, lab integration, etc.), to identify and mitigate risks from scientific superintelligence while retaining the core scientific discovery capabilities of the stack. The initial focus of this team will be to build and implement a bespoke safety strategy for Lila, tailored to its specific goals and deployment strategies. This will involve technical safety strategy development, broader ecosystem engagement, safety-focused evaluations, safety systems to mitigate risks, and a research agenda that explores longer-term needs such as oversight of superintelligent scientific systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-quality safety depends on the right expertise, consistent and repeatable workflows and high levels of interpretability. At Lila Sciences, you will turn scientific risk questions into well-run expert-data and evaluation programs to build this evidence-base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring a strong working understanding of AI safety and scientific misuse risks to connect internal risk mapping and threat modeling with expertise across Lila and external specialists. Your primary responsibilities will be program execution and data quality: organizing contributors, running red-teaming and evaluation campaigns, and ensuring their outputs meet agreed standards. You will also be responsible for gathering targeted high-impact feedback from partners in the AI Safety community on our different aspects of our approach to Safety. You will work closely with scientists who frame the research questions and interpret their significance, while creating the operational conditions for their expertise to have an impact. Ultimately, you will play a key role in generating the evidence that informs safety decisions made by senior leadership at Lila.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate agreed scientific briefs into executable plans covering tasks, contributor needs, instructions, milestones, quality standards and delivery expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and coordinate external experts with scientific colleagues, and organize access to relevant expertise within Lila.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage contributor onboarding, task assignment, training and support so specialists can contribute effectively and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run expert-data collection, annotation, red-teaming and evaluation programs, tracking progress and resolving delivery problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish quality controls covering completeness, consistency, provenance and adherence to rubrics; coordinate calibration, review, disagreement resolution and rework with scientific owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear records, versioned guidance and usable datasets, and improve workflows based on quality findings and researcher feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify questions that require scientific judgment and bring them to the appropriate specialists, ensuring decisions are reflected in program materials and subsequent work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering expert-data, research-operations, evaluation or similarly demanding programs involving specialist contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A substantial working understanding of AI safety, including how threat models, capability evaluations, red teaming and safeguards inform one another. You should be able to interpret a safety research brief, recognize its assumptions and the consequences of data-quality failures, and identify when a question needs scientific escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of applying this safety understanding in research, evaluation or expert-data work, including how it shaped the scoping, execution or review of a program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational judgment and the ability to manage dependencies, changing requirements and several parallel workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of setting measurable quality standards, detecting recurring problems and improving the processes that produce data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, careful documentation and the ability to build effective relationships with researchers, experts and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sufficient technical and scientific fluency to understand research briefs, clarify ambiguity and work productively with subject-matter experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to scientific study design, assessing scientific validity or developing evaluation rubrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeper scientific expertise or research experience in biology, chemistry or materials science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis, scripting, annotation platforms or tools for tracking research workflows and data provenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive base compensation with bonus potential and generous early-stage equity. Your final offer will reflect your background, expertise, and expected impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time U.S. employees receive a comprehensive benefits program including medical, dental, and vision coverage; employer-paid life and disability insurance; flexible time off with generous company wide holidays; paid parental leave; an educational assistance program; commuter benefits, including bike share memberships for office based employees; and a company subsidized lunch program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employees outside the U.S. receive a comprehensive benefits program tailored to their region. USD salary ranges apply only to U.S.-based positions; international salaries are set to local market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Expected Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$144,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LILA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is building Scientific Superintelligence™ to solve humankind&#39;s greatest challenges. We believe science is the most inspiring frontier for AI. Rather than hard-coding expert knowledge into tools, LILA builds systems that can learn for themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LILA combines advanced AI models with proprietary AI Science Factory™ instruments into an operating system for science that executes the entire scientific method autonomously, accelerating discovery at unprecedented speed, scale, and impact across medicine, materials, and energy. Learn more at www.lila.ai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided by our core values of truth, trust, curiosity, grit, and velocity, we move with startup speed while tackling problems of historic importance. If this sounds like an environment you&#39;d love to work in, even if you don&#39;t meet every qualification listed above, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re All In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is&amp;nbsp;committed to equal employment opportunity&amp;nbsp;regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information you provide during your application process will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lila.ai/candidate-privacy-policy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note to Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lila Sciences does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than candidates. The submission of unsolicited resumes by recruitment or staffing agencies to Lila Sciences or its employees is strictly prohibited unless contacted directly by Lila Science’s internal Talent Acquisition team. Any resume submitted by an agency in the absence of a signed agreement will automatically become the property of Lila Sciences, and Lila Sciences will not owe any referral or other fees with respect thereto.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;&quot;&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we&#39;ve set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you&#39;ll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We&#39;re a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does the team work on?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the No. 1 TV streaming platform in the US, Canada and Mexico, with more than 100 million active accounts. Every ad impression across that platform has to be cleared and priced in real time — that is what the Ads Auctions and Marketplace Optimization team does. We build the auction mechanics, the pricing and pacing logic, and the low-latency systems that run them, balancing outcomes for advertisers, publishers, viewers, and Roku on every request. We are growing the team in Cambridge, which is becoming its largest hub, alongside colleagues in Amsterdam, Austin, San Jose, Ukraine and Uruguay — so you would be shaping how the UK side of this team works rather than inheriting it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the systems that apply mathematical and algorithmic rigour to optimise across multiple objectives, deciding which ads get served, in which placements, and when. The work spans auction mechanics, optimisation, the output of predictive ML models, and the real-time infrastructure underneath, mostly in Java on the JVM. It is hands-on and senior in scope: expect to move between whiteboard-level design and production code in the same week, and to own problems from framing through rollout. You will work directly with the hiring manager and a small group of senior engineers, in codebases shared with other ads engineers, on problems where your decisions are visible in revenue. You will optimise for second-order effects in a marketplace where participants react to each other, and to us, in real time. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about solving these kinds of problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will I use AI at Roku?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Roku, we don&#39;t just use AI, we work with it. AI agents and smart tools help power drafts, analysis, and repetitive workflows, while our people bring direction, judgment, and accountability. We&#39;re looking for curious, adaptable builders who can show how they&#39;ve used AI or automation to move faster, raise the bar, and scale their impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value your AI skills if you have built fluency across the agentic engineering toolchain — coding harnesses like Claude Code or Cursor, MCP servers, custom skills, or agent frameworks. And you can describe projects where you shipped real work with these tools. You know how to drive an agent, verify its output, and ramp on an unfamiliar codebase with an agent helping you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the responsibilities of the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build components of Roku&#39;s real-time ad auction and marketplace systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the multi-objective optimisation at the core of the auction, balancing what advertisers, publishers, viewers, and Roku each want from the same impression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own development work end to end, from framing the problem through production rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate JVM services where latency and reliability are product requirements, not stretch goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use probability, statistics and experimentation to test changes before and after launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI tooling as a normal part of how you design, build, test and review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain technical trade-offs clearly to engineering and cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What experience would help someone be successful in this role at Roku?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around six or more years building production software, with strong systems judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience in Java or another JVM language, or depth in a comparable statically typed language such as C#, C++ or Go, and the appetite to ramp on Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort designing and operating distributed systems at scale and low latency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid grounding in maths, algorithms, probability and statistics as applied to real systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI and agentic-tooling fluency, as described above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad tech, auctions or marketplace experience is preferred, and we move quickly for candidates who have it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comparable experience on mathematically rigorous or optimisation-heavy problems in another domain is an acceptable alternative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-MS3&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Roku&#39;s approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days&#39; a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It&#39;s important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku&#39;s culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company&#39;s success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We&#39;re independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you&#39;ll be part of a company that&#39;s changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn&#39;t real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we&#39;ve grown, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&quot;&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;&quot;&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we&#39;ve set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you&#39;ll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We&#39;re a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What does the team work on?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ads Customer Interfaces team develops full-stack web application services, APIs, and UIs that provide a unified approach to interfacing with internal and external customers across Roku&#39;s suite of advertising products. Our mission is to provide the best-in-class user experience and service while aiming to delight users of our products by making their jobs easier and allowing them to focus on their customers instead of getting bogged down by tedious business processes. In this role, you will work as a key member of the Ads Customer Interfaces team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What is the role?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku pioneered streaming to the TV and continues to innovate and lead the industry. While we are well-positioned to help shape the future of television and streaming media worldwide, continued success stems from experienced software engineers like you developing core features for the Roku platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our new Senior Software Engineer will be contributing extensively to our container orchestrated platform, bringing together some of the latest web technologies with Ai expertise to develop a truly scalable and responsive web applications. To be successful you’ll need extensive experience of building reliable and scalable cloud-based solutions, a strong background in software engineering and an appetite to keep on top of modern software practices. This is a great role for a senior professional who enjoys a high level of visibility and thrives on great business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The features and performance improvements you implement directly impact millions of users every day. This is a great role for an experienced professional who has innovative ideas for complex problems and can translate these ideas into ultra-reliable software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How will I use AI at Roku?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;At Roku, we don’t just use AI, we work with it. AI agents and smart tools help power drafts, analysis, and repetitive workflows, while our people bring direction, judgment, and accountability. We’re looking for curious, adaptable builders who can show how they’ve used AI or automation to move faster, raise the bar, and scale their impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We value your AI skills if have built fluency across the agentic engineering toolchain — coding harnesses like Claude Code or Cursor, MCP servers, custom skills, or agent frameworks. And you can describe projects where you shipped real work with these tools. You know how to drive an agent, verify its output, and ramp on an unfamiliar codebase with an agent helping you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What are the responsiblities of the role?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and deliver high-quality web applications and back-end services with modern frameworks and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as a part of a high functioning team consisting of UX designers, software engineers, dev-ops, quality assurance and product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and integrate AI-powered features into web applications and enterprise tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) solutions to power chatbot interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work both independently and paired with other team members to ensure efficient delivery of prioritised features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the planning and refinement of features along with the team to come up with innovative and collaborative designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new features and write test cases to ensure the quality of your code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with CI/CD tools to ensure that all software developed adheres to both quality and scaling requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a role in continuously improving our software delivery process, making it as efficient as possible, reducing wasteful activities and creating value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See a feature go all the way from design stage to being deployed into customer facing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to dig deep to find solutions to challenging problems affecting our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What experience would help someone be successful in this role at Roku?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive expeirence&amp;nbsp; in JavaScript/TypeScript and modern web frameworks (React, Next.js, Angular, Node.js, Express) on cloud-based technology, such as AWS and GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building large scale and low latency distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of algorithms, data structures, performance optimisation techniques, object-oriented programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using modern AI-assisted and agentic development workflows in day-to-day engineering using&amp;nbsp;AI/ML APIs and SDKs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing RAG solutions or working with LLMs for chatbots is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of CI/CD and the tools used to implement them, such as Jenkins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software repository tools, such as GitLab and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with productivity tools, such as Jira and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of Agile practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to accurately estimate software tasks and work to schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to observability tools and practices (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana) are preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of databases and data architecture choices (SQL vs NoSQL, caching layers, and data access patterns)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of tuning performance and reliability for highly available services and web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web security fundamentals and secure engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors of Masters Degree in Compute Science/Software Engineering or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-PA1&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Roku&#39;s approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days&#39; a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It&#39;s important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku&#39;s culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company&#39;s success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We&#39;re independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you&#39;ll be part of a company that&#39;s changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn&#39;t real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we&#39;ve grown, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&quot;&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Corporate Account Executive, Public Sector, you will own new-logo acquisition across a defined vertical and account set in the UK, Ireland and South Africa. Your focus will be public sector organisations with 2,000–7,499 employees. This is a dedicated new-business role and you are unlikely to inherit existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will use available account, industry and SKU growth data to create, own and execute a clear territory strategy focused on sustainable net-new ARR growth. You will manage the full sales cycle—from prospecting and opportunity creation through procurement, negotiation and close—while building trusted relationships with business, technical, procurement and executive stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a self-sourcing role. You will have access to Business Development, Solutions Engineering, Partner Account Management and marketing resources, but this support is intended to complement—not replace—your personal accountability for creating pipeline. As a channel-first organisation, close alignment with the Partner Account Manager and partner ecosystem will be central to how you develop routes to market, generate demand and win business. Customer Success support will become available once a customer reaches the applicable ARR threshold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating, validating, owning and executing a data-led territory and account plan that sets out how you will achieve an annual net-new ARR target of approximately $900,000 USD once fully ramped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using account intelligence, industry trends, SKU performance and growth data to prioritise target accounts, identify whitespace and focus resources on the strongest ARR opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally sourcing pipeline through disciplined prospecting, executive outreach, networking, events, social selling and account-based activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the BDR to increase coverage and accelerate opportunity creation, while retaining personal ownership of pipeline generation and territory performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading new-logo acquisition across assigned public sector accounts within your defined vertical, with no reliance on an inherited customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the full sales cycle from initial engagement and qualification through discovery, solution development, business case, procurement, negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating effectively within a channel-first model by working closely with the PAM to build and execute partner-led account plans and routes to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing productive relationships with resellers, framework providers, distributors, system integrators and strategic alliance partners to create pipeline and close business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and progressing opportunities through public procurement frameworks, tenders, direct awards and other compliant purchasing routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Solutions Engineering to shape discovery, technical validation, demonstrations and solution design around customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with marketing to develop and execute targeted vertical, territory and account-based campaigns that generate measurable pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging Customer Success at the appropriate stage for customers that meet the applicable ARR threshold, ensuring a strong transition from sale to adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing complex sales cycles involving procurement, IT leadership, information governance, security, records management, finance and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positioning AvePoint&#39;s platform solutions against public sector priorities including digital transformation, cyber resilience, AI adoption, compliance, data governance and modern workplace initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering compelling presentations, workshops and value-based business cases that demonstrate measurable outcomes, commercial impact and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining an accurate, current and sufficiently covered pipeline, forecast and account strategy within the CRM, with clear next steps and stakeholder ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending virtual and face-to-face customer meetings, partner engagements, industry events and conferences across the territory as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is this the role for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who combines agility, passion, accountability and teamwork with the commercial drive to build a territory from the ground up. You will be comfortable creating your own opportunities, mobilising supporting resources and remaining accountable for the overall ARR outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will understand how public sector organisations buy technology and be able to translate policy priorities, funding signals, market trends and customer challenges into focused account plans and commercially qualified opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be strategic and data-led, but equally willing to execute. Success requires a consistent prospecting cadence, disciplined qualification, strong internal orchestration and effective use of BDR, SE, PAM and marketing support without becoming dependent on those resources for pipeline creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy winning new logos, developing partner-led routes to market, navigating complex public procurement and helping organisations achieve meaningful outcomes through technology, this role offers the opportunity to build and own a high-growth public sector territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and qualities required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in a new-business software, SaaS, cloud, cybersecurity, information management or enterprise technology sales role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to self-source, develop and close net-new business opportunities against an ARR or recurring-revenue target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and executing a territory plan for a defined account set, segment or vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into public sector organisations is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of public procurement processes, framework agreements, tendering environments and partner-led purchasing routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong channel mindset, with experience working effectively with Partner Account Managers, resellers, system integrators and alliance ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use market, account and performance data to prioritise activity and make sound commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging and influencing executive, business, procurement and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative, value-based sales approach with the ability to develop credible business cases and articulate measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prospecting, communication, presentation, negotiation and listening skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple complex opportunities and coordinate cross-functional resources without losing personal accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting discipline and experience maintaining accurate pipeline and account data in CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience, curiosity, pace and a clear ownership mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-competitive compensation including bonus scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career progression and internal mobility opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of annual leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GBP 1.000,00/Year towards our Tuition Reimbursement Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Referral Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Donation Matching Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company sponsored events / regular team building events &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra paid perk days - Birthday off, Family/Life Event Day, Volunteering...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, self-motivated &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Search &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you’ll help build and evolve the customer-facing search experiences that help users discover relevant, high-quality content, along with the backend systems that power them. You’ll work across the stack, with a slight emphasis on frontend development, and collaborate closely with engineers, Product, and Design to deliver intuitive search experiences backed by reliable, scalable search and data systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver customer-facing search features and workflows across frontend and backend systems, from technical planning through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered product experiences end to end, from the services behind them to the interfaces that make their output useful and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build intuitive, responsive user experiences using Vue while contributing to the Python and Django services that power them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve search, indexing, and retrieval systems that support high-quality content discovery across large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain features and data workflows that leverage technologies such as Elasticsearch, Kafka, Celery, and MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful technical decisions and trade-offs that balance customer experience, delivery speed, performance, reliability, and long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and engineering teammates to shape solutions, clarify requirements, and deliver high-quality customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues and drive improvements to the performance, reliability, observability, and maintainability of the systems you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call and incident response rotation, helping diagnose and resolve production issues and improve system reliability over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working across frontend and backend systems and independently delivering features throughout the application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Python or a similar programming language and experience with Django or a comparable web framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building polished, maintainable user-facing applications with Vue.js or another modern JavaScript framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Elasticsearch or a comparable search technology, or significant experience working with data-intensive systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making technical trade-offs within complex production systems while balancing immediate delivery needs with long-term quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience diagnosing production issues and contributing to the reliability and operational health of the systems you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TypeScript in a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design systems or shared component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adjust working hours for overlap with teammates in US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or other streaming or event-driven technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MySQL, Postgres, or other relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Celery or other asynchronous task-processing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building search, discovery, indexing, or information-retrieval features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving frontend architecture, performance, or complex customer-facing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-traffic SaaS applications or systems that process large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer-facing features backed by LLMs or other AI models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience judging whether an AI-backed feature is actually working, through evaluation, testing, or user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in journalism, news, media, or social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Addition, We&#39;re Always Looking for Candidates Who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex technical ideas clearly and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of problems and drive work forward independently while knowing when to involve others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in building readable, testable, maintainable software while making pragmatic technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach ambiguous or complex problems thoughtfully and use sound judgment to identify effective solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong engineering culture through thoughtful code reviews, knowledge sharing, feedback, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,000+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
