&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By applying, you acknowledge that BridgeBio will process your personal information as described in our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAd6c4e04b-5992-fd9b-e886-799643d2664a&quot; class=&quot;OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://bridgebio.com/bridgebio-global-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;9e62afb3-8bc4-44ae-b141-da3313dafb85&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. Questions or requests:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA78554186-1b78-c42a-b026-6470b3df2bb4&quot; class=&quot;OWAAutoLink&quot; ----- -----
